OL,3,GNEWSA'Miracle' daughter born after
OL,4,Afather's cancer news
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was diagnosed with cancer
OL,7,Fsays his sperm donation one hour before
OL,8,Fhe started chemotherapy led to the
OL,9,Fbirth of his "miracle" daughter.
OL,11,FLuke, 38, from Lincoln, was diagnosed
OL,12,Fwith stage four bile duct cancer in
OL,13,FApril 2025.
OL,15,FOn the morning he started treatment he
OL,16,Fdonated his sperm for IVF with his
OL,17,Fpartner, Lois. Their daughter Birdie
OL,18,Fwas born in July 2026.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
