OL,3,GNEWSA'Miracle' daughter born after
OL,4,Afather's cancer news
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiam said: "If I didn't have Lois and
OL,7,FBirdie, I think cancer would control my
OL,8,Flife. It would dictate what I do hour
OL,9,Fby hour, minute by minute and I'd
OL,10,Fconstantly be thinking about it. But
OL,11,FI've got so many happy distractions in
OL,12,Fmy life that I can take control back."
